[{"answer":"Hi Sue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi Mike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/2.mp3"},{"answer":"So what happened to you last week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I was sick with the flu.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/4.mp3"},{"answer":"What's this I hear about a big assignment we've got to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, well, basically, we've got to find two science experiments","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/6.mp3"},{"answer":"to do with a group of 8-year-old children at the local primary school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've got to complete it by the end of the week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/8.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds like hard work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Where are we supposed to get the ideas for these experiments from?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I managed to get hold of two books from the library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, well done!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/12.mp3"},{"answer":"How about if we take a look at the experiments in this book first","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and see if anything looks suitable?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I can make notes as we go, about equipment and the purpose of the experiments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/16.mp3"},{"answer":"the first experiment is called 'Make your own hovercraft',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/17.mp3"},{"answer":"which sounds very ambitious!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Mind you, you only need 20 balloons and a table -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/19.mp3"},{"answer":"you don't need any special engines or anything like that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/20.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you do with it all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, you blow up the balloons and you balance the table on them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/22.mp3"},{"answer":"upside down of course, and the kids get to ride around on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/23.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, the other kids sort of push them around the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/24.mp3"},{"answer":"The main purpose is to show how hovercrafts work,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and how things hover around on just a cushion of air.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, that doesn't sound too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, ready for number two?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Now this one is called 'Unusual Measures of Lengths',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and you basically use lots of paperclips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The kids go around the class measuring things -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/31.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, how long the desk is, and that sort of thing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and then they all compare their answers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And, basically, because not all paperclips are the same lengths,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/34.mp3"},{"answer":"they should come up with some strange answers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It's supposed to demonstrate the importance of having fixed units of measurement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's not bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, now for number three you need rock salt or copper sulphate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'm not sure about that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, just put down the rock salt then...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/40.mp3"},{"answer":"apart from that you only need a jar of water.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And basically you dissolve lots of salt into the water","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and watch the crystals form,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/43.mp3"},{"answer":"so it basically teaches the kids about growing crystals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I suppose it would be nice to grow something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, let's move on and have a look at number four.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, this one is called 'Spinning colour wheel'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It looks like you get some cardboard and draw a circle on it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/48.mp3"},{"answer":"divide it into six equal segments and colour each one in using different colours,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/49.mp3"},{"answer":"then you thread a piece of string through the middle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So we'd need some string as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, sorry...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and you spin the wheel around","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and if you can get it spinning fast enough,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/54.mp3"},{"answer":"hopefully the colours all merge and show up as white.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I didn't know that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/56.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the principle behind it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well it's pretty elementary physics, really.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It teaches them about how white light or ordinary light is made up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, well that doesn't sound too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Now there's only one more left in this book isn't there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/61.mp3"},{"answer":"What does that one say?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, well it's another one where they'd get to make something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds very interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/64.mp3"},{"answer":"You need quite a lot of equipment actually -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/65.mp3"},{"answer":"a hand drill, an old record,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/66.mp3"},{"answer":"a pin or needle, some paper and a bolt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, go on, what do they have to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they basically make a record player.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/69.mp3"},{"answer":"The main idea is to teach them about recording sound,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but hopefully they'd also see that you need motion and an amplifier to make the sound heard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well it does sound interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall we go through all of those again and decide if any of them are going to be suitable?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, number one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought this one sounded nice: there'd be lots of activity","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and it doesn't need too much in the way of equipment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's true, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/77.mp3"},{"answer":"don't you think it's a bit risky to get a group of 8-year-olds pushing each other around a classroom like that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Someone could get hurt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/79.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I don't like the sound of that one at all!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/81.mp3"},{"answer":"What about number two, with the paperclips?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/82.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds tame enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, a bit too tame if you ask me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/84.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it needs to be something a bit more active and interesting than that, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I suppose you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/86.mp3"},{"answer":"We won't get a very good mark if the children don't actually enjoy the experiments,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/87.mp3"},{"answer":"and I suppose we could turn them off science for good!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, what about the next one, number three?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I quite like the idea of this one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, so do I,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/91.mp3"},{"answer":"but I seem to remember when we did it at high school","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/92.mp3"},{"answer":"we had to wait up to a fortnight before we saw any halfway decent results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/93.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes well, that won't be any good then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/94.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll only see the kids for one or two hours at the most.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/95.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and we have to do the experiments and write up our results within a week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/96.mp3"},{"answer":"so that one won't do at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well, what did you think of number four?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/98.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the idea of it, but","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/99.mp3"},{"answer":"do you think it will be a bit elementary for them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/100.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they are only eight you know!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/101.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, but you know what I mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/102.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't you think the activity itself is a bit babyish?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/103.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm, maybe you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/104.mp3"},{"answer":"They might have fun but, I mean, cutting out a circle and colouring it in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/105.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well, what about number five?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/106.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought this one sounded a bit too good to be true - great equipment!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/107.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/108.mp3"},{"answer":"But don't you think it's a bit ambitious for this age group?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/109.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, I don't want to start off something and then have to abandon it if they just can't cope with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/110.mp3"},{"answer":"I could see us ending up doing just about all of the work for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/111.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/112.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh well, maybe we could store that idea away for later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/113.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep, let's hope this second book has something better!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-4-part-3-2023-08-13-18-10-51/114.mp3"}]
